---
// The 4 Observability Signals (Logs, Traces, Metrics, Profiles) + RED/USE & Histogram p99 traps.
const W = 900;
const H = 310;
---
<figure class="ge6a">
  <div class="ge6a-scroll">
    <svg viewBox={`0 0 ${W} ${H}`} role="img" aria-label="Comparing the four observability signals for efficiency—Logging, Tracing, Metrics, and Profiling—alongside why Prometheus Histograms capture p99 tail spikes better than averages.">
      {/* Top half: 4 Signals cards */}
      <rect x="14" y="14" width="206" height="128" rx="8" class="ge6a-card" />
      <text x="28" y="38" class="ge6a-b">1. Logging</text>
      <text x="28" y="58" class="ge6a-m">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Discrete event text</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Dòng log từng sự kiện</tspan>
      </text>
      <text x="28" y="76" class="ge6a-m">
        <tspan data-lang-en>• High cost on hot paths</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>• Rất tốn I/O nếu log nhiều</tspan>
      </text>
      <text x="28" y="94" class="ge6a-m">
        <tspan data-lang-en>• Good for rare errors</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>• Hợp để ghi lỗi hiếm gặp</tspan>
      </text>
      <text x="28" y="122" class="ge6a-b-red">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Skip Debug logs in loops</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Tránh log Debug trong vòng lặp</tspan>
      </text>

      <rect x="236" y="14" width="206" height="128" rx="8" class="ge6a-card" />
      <text x="250" y="38" class="ge6a-b">2. Distributed Tracing</text>
      <text x="250" y="58" class="ge6a-m">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Single-request span timeline</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Dòng thời gian từng request</tspan>
      </text>
      <text x="250" y="76" class="ge6a-m">
        <tspan data-lang-en>• Shows cross-service waits</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>• Thấy ngay khâu nào chờ lâu</tspan>
      </text>
      <text x="250" y="94" class="ge6a-m">
        <tspan data-lang-en>• Needs head/tail sampling</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>• Cần sample kẻo nghẽn mạng</tspan>
      </text>
      <text x="250" y="122" class="ge6a-b-ok">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Links slow p99 → DB call</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Nối trực tiếp p99 → lệnh DB</tspan>
      </text>

      <rect x="458" y="14" width="206" height="128" rx="8" class="ge6a-card is-ok" />
      <text x="472" y="38" class="ge6a-b-ok">3. Metrics (RED / USE)</text>
      <text x="472" y="58" class="ge6a-m">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Cheap aggregated counters</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>• Số đếm gộp rất nhẹ RAM</tspan>
      </text>
      <text x="472" y="76" class="ge6a-m">
        <tspan data-lang-en>• RED: Rate, Errors, Duration</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>• RED: Tốc độ, Lỗi, Thời gian</tspan>
      </text>
      <text x="472" y="94" class="ge6a-m">
        <tspan data-lang-en>• USE: Util, Sat, Errors</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>• USE: Tải, Nghẽn hàng đợi</tspan>
      </text>
      <text x="472" y="122" class="ge6a-b-ok">
        <tspan data-lang-en>First alarm via Histograms</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Cảnh báo sớm qua Histogram</tspan>
      </text>

      <rect x="680" y="14" width="206" height="128" rx="8" class="ge6a-card is-red" />
      <text x="694" y="38" class="ge6a-b-red">4. Profiling (pprof)</text>
      <text x="694" y="58" class="ge6a-m">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Code-line resource attribution</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Đo chi phí tới từng dòng code</tspan>
      </text>
      <text x="694" y="76" class="ge6a-m">
        <tspan data-lang-en>• CPU ns &amp; Heap allocs</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>• Gom theo call stack</tspan>
      </text>
      <text x="694" y="94" class="ge6a-m">
        <tspan data-lang-en>• Continuous mode (&lt; 5% CPU)</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>• Chạy nền nhẹ (&lt; 5% CPU)</tspan>
      </text>
      <text x="694" y="122" class="ge6a-b-red">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Answers WHY CPU/RAM spiked</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Trả lời TẠI SAO tốn CPU/RAM</tspan>
      </text>

      {/* Bottom: Mean hides latency spikes; Histogram catches p99 */}
      <rect x="14" y="160" width="872" height="134" rx="10" class="ge6a-card" />
      <text x="30" y="188" class="ge6a-h">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Why average latency lies — and how Prometheus Histograms catch tail latency</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Tại sao con số trung bình đánh lừa — và cách Histogram bắt đúng độ trễ đuôi p99</tspan>
      </text>

      <rect x="30" y="204" width="380" height="72" rx="6" class="ge6a-box is-red" />
      <text x="44" y="226" class="ge6a-b-red">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Averaging sum / count (avg = 12 ms):</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Lấy trung bình sum / count (avg = 12 ms):</tspan>
      </text>
      <text x="44" y="246" class="ge6a-m">
        <tspan data-lang-en>99 fast requests (5 ms) + 1 stalled request (705 ms)</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>99 request nhanh (5 ms) + 1 request treo (705 ms)</tspan>
      </text>
      <text x="44" y="264" class="ge6a-m">
        <tspan data-lang-en>looks fine as a 12 ms mean while 1% of users time out.</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>tính ra trung bình vẫn êm dù 1% khách bị treo rụng.</tspan>
      </text>

      <rect x="430" y="204" width="438" height="72" rx="6" class="ge6a-box is-ok" />
      <text x="444" y="226" class="ge6a-b-ok">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Histogram buckets (le=0.01, 0.05, 0.25, +Inf):</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Chia giỏ Histogram (le=0.01s, 0.05s, 0.25s, +Inf):</tspan>
      </text>
      <text x="444" y="246" class="ge6a-m">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Tracks counts per latency range → compute p90 / p99 via</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Đếm số lần rơi vào từng ngưỡng → tính chính xác p90 / p99</tspan>
      </text>
      <text x="444" y="264" class="ge6a-b">histogram_quantile(0.99, rate(http_duration_bucket[5m]))</text>
    </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>Pick the lightest observability signal first: Prometheus RED/USE histograms spot tail spikes cheaply across thousands of requests, traces isolate the slow hop, and pprof explains the hot code line.</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>Chọn tín hiệu nhẹ trước: Histogram (RED/USE) rẻ tiền và bắt ngay tụt áp ở p99; Tracing chỉ ra mắt xích chậm giữa các service; còn pprof soi thẳng xuống dòng code ngốn CPU hay RAM.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .ge6a { margin: 2em 0; width: 100%; }
  .ge6a-scroll { overflow-x: auto; }
  .ge6a svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 640px; height: auto; }
  .ge6a text { font-size: 12px; fill: var(--text-body); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .ge6a-card { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.5; }
  .ge6a-card.is-red { stroke: var(--red); fill: var(--red-tint-bg); }
  .ge6a-card.is-ok { stroke: rgb(21, 128, 61); }
  :global(html[data-theme='dark']) .ge6a-card.is-ok { stroke: rgb(74, 222, 128); }
  .ge6a-box { fill: var(--bg); stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.2; }
  .ge6a-box.is-red { stroke: var(--red); fill: var(--red-tint-bg); }
  .ge6a-box.is-ok { stroke: rgb(21, 128, 61); }
  :global(html[data-theme='dark']) .ge6a-box.is-ok { stroke: rgb(74, 222, 128); }
  .ge6a-h { font-size: 13.5px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .ge6a-b { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .ge6a-b-red { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--red); }
  .ge6a-b-ok { font-weight: 700; fill: rgb(21, 128, 61); }
  :global(html[data-theme='dark']) .ge6a-b-ok { fill: rgb(74, 222, 128); }
  .ge6a-m { fill: var(--text-muted); font-size: 11px; }
  .ge6a figcaption { margin-top: 10px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.55; text-align: center; }
</style>
